 i would take this with a  grain of salt i don't know how accurate  the article actually is as a matter of  fact the dragon demands is already  saying james hibbard is lying i honestly  have no idea what to believe right now  i just woke up around 8 am and this  information was the first thing i saw  it's not even 30 minutes later and i'm  sitting here gathering my thoughts as we  speak now whether this actually happens  or not i do think this makes a lot of  sense if this would happen hbo would  most likely throw a lot of money at kid  harrington to bring him back and  although he may not have initially  wanted to step back into jon snow's role  he might reconsider if he doesn't like  any of the other offers hollywood is  giving him he wasn't the eternals but i  don't know anyone that liked it if he  became jon snow again he would  immediately become one of the most  famous characters on television  something i know has to be very tempting  especially if hbo would throw the bank  at him again i actually discussed this  very same thing happening in one of my  recent videos i said a lot of the game  of thrones actors would consider coming  back to westeros again once they realize  they might never work in something this  big again maisie williams has already  flirted with this idea before she  certainly sounds like she would be open  to acting as arya stark again and i  would bet she's not the only one now  would any of them coming back actually  makes sense as you all know game of  thrones left with a lot of open-ended  story lines at the end of game of  thrones season 8. not only that but  besides maybe daenerys targaryen jon  snow is one of their most recognizable  characters i think if hbo really wants  to find success after game of thrones a  jon snow successor show is more likely  to bring back a lot of the fans than a  house of the dragon show when you  consider every game of thrones fan knows  who jon snow is whereas only the  hardcore fans know about the dance of  the dragons now i don't want anyone to  think i'm saying a jon snow series would  automatically be a hit you would still  have to find great raiders to make the  show make sense just because fans  recognize jon snow doesn't mean they  will watch anything the character is  involved in he would obviously have to  have something interesting to do  now as we all know when game of thrones  ended jon snow is heading north of the  walwood ghost and a very small group of  wildlings as far as we know there's  nothing interesting left north of the  wall we were led to believe the white  walkers are dead but that doesn't mean  they have to stay dead forever there are  many different ways they could bring  them back as well as some of the other  characters we came to know and love in  game of thrones i actually wrote out an  entire season 9 for game of thrones  which you can find in my list of videos  now i'm not saying any of those ideas  are great ideas but what i did was have  daenerys get brought back to life by ken  vara an idea that was already  circulating around the internet  immediately after the final season was  over i also had brian stark be the next  evil villain something that could easily  be set up through his connection with  the three-eyed raven the children of the  forest and even the night king i had  already long suspected that the children  of the forest and the three-eyed raven  were not who we thought they were in  order for them to make john cena's story  interesting again they would most likely  have to bring him south to fight in  other battles or remove bran from king's  landing after finding out he is still  being influenced by a faction of the  children of the forest who are living at  the god's eye or jon snow would have to  come south again if daenerys and drogon  came back to westeros unleashing their  hellish fire again but i don't think hbo  would want to bring her back just to do  the same thing over they could expect  the fans to have the same reaction they  did the first time daenerys went mad now  another thing you could do is have grey  worm come back and kill jon snow when  and if he ever found out jon was south  again also if daenerys did come back to  life and she still had drogon how would  she react to jon snow murdering her  would she immediately want revenge or  would she be willing to set that aside  to fight for the greater good assuming  there was another evil force amassing in  westeros or even essos  now these are only a few ideas i will  throw out there for right now if you  want to know how a season 9 of game of  thrones could work go watch my full  season 9 rewrite obviously they would  need some great writers to flesh  everything out but either way there is  still some story to be told if they  really wanted to  since hbo has the rights to a song of  ice and fire they don't even need george  rr martin to sign on to it i'm not  saying that would be a wise decision but  they could move forward with the idea  whether or not they had his blessing i  mean they kind of did that with game of  thrones already after they no longer had  his novels to follow again i do want to  say i don't know if the article was  accurate i will need a confirmation from  hbo before i fully believe anything with  that being said i do think it could work  my final thoughts are mr harrington  might be willing to do this if hbo  throws him a lot of money and if he  thinks this would be a better option  than whatever offers he's currently  getting like i said he could immediately  go from being forgotten to one of the  most famous actors on television again  i also think hbo could make this work if  they hired solid writers there are a lot  of ways jon snow could have an  interesting story as long as they  created some conflict for him again i'm  sure they also wouldn't mind rewriting  game of thrones history through a new  show i'm sure they've already been  thinking about how they could make game  of thrones ending more digestible now  with that being said they could also  make things a lot worse if they bring  back these characters just to mess it up  all over again they would obviously be  walking a very fine line  and at the end of the day they don't  even need george rr martin to sign on to  it they still own all of the rights to  game of thrones in a song of ice and  fire so they could make just about any  show they want  now i am sure there will be a lot of  fans who hate the idea but just like  with house of the dragon i guarantee  they will be watching any new shows as  soon as they are released as always i  will let you know if any new information  is released regarding the new jon snow  show or anything else involving game of  thrones house of the dragon or the winds  of winter make sure you subscribe so you  can stay up to date on any and all  information i want to thank all of you  for stopping by and watching the video i  hope you all have a great day i will see  you soon  bye  so  [Music]  so  you

